{"seq":2,"slug":"link-prediction","title":"链接预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/network-graph-analysis/models/link-prediction","wordCount":1441,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"链接预测\">链接预测</h1><p>「你可能认识的人」「猜你喜欢」「这两个蛋白质或许会结合」——这些产品功能背后是同一个问题：给定当前的图，下一条边最可能出现在哪里？链接预测把网络分析从描述既有结构推向<strong>预测缺失或未来的连接</strong>。它大量复用前面的成果：特征是 <a href=\"../metrics/centrality\">中心性</a> 和 <a href=\"graph-embeddings\">图嵌入</a>，零模型是 <a href=\"random-graph-models\">随机图模型</a>。这一篇讲清从启发式到机器学习的方法谱系，并重点讲一个最易踩的坑——评估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>链接预测方法大致分三层：基于局部相似性的启发式、把问题转成二分类的监督学习、以及基于表示学习的嵌入方法。下图展示这个谱系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  LP[链接预测] --&gt; HEUR[相似性启发式]&#10;  HEUR --&gt; CN[共同邻居]&#10;  HEUR --&gt; AA[Adamic-Adar]&#10;  HEUR --&gt; RA[资源分配]&#10;  HEUR --&gt; JAC[Jaccard]&#10;  LP --&gt; ML[监督二分类]&#10;  ML --&gt; FEAT[拼接节点对特征]&#10;  LP --&gt; EMB[嵌入方法]&#10;  EMB --&gt; DOT[&quot;向量内积/Hadamard&quot;]&#10;  LP --&gt; EVAL[评估]&#10;  EVAL --&gt; SPLIT[&quot;时间/随机切分&quot;]&#10;  EVAL --&gt; METRIC[&quot;AUPR/Hits@K&quot;]\">graph TD\n  LP[链接预测] --&gt; HEUR[相似性启发式]\n  HEUR --&gt; CN[共同邻居]\n  HEUR --&gt; AA[Adamic-Adar]\n  HEUR --&gt; RA[资源分配]\n  HEUR --&gt; JAC[Jaccard]\n  LP --&gt; ML[监督二分类]\n  ML --&gt; FEAT[拼接节点对特征]\n  LP --&gt; EMB[嵌入方法]\n  EMB --&gt; DOT[\"向量内积/Hadamard\"]\n  LP --&gt; EVAL[评估]\n  EVAL --&gt; SPLIT[\"时间/随机切分\"]\n  EVAL --&gt; METRIC[\"AUPR/Hits@K\"]</pre><p>下表对照三类方法的代价、可解释性与典型表现。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>需要训练</th>\n<th>可解释性</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相似性启发式</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>快速基线、稀疏大图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监督二分类</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>有节点/边特征时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入方法</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>复杂结构、需高准确率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"相似性启发式-便宜的强基线\">相似性启发式：便宜的强基线</h2><p>最简单的链接预测假设「有共同邻居的两个点更可能连边」。对节点对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<strong>共同邻居</strong>直接数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∩</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|N(u) \\cap N(v)|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。它的问题是不区分邻居质量——一个连了几万人的明星做共同邻居，远不如一个只连了三人的小圈子有说服力。</p>\n<p><strong>Adamic–Adar</strong> 和<strong>资源分配</strong>正是为此对共同邻居按其度做惩罚加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AA</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∩</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>RA</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∩</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AA}(u,v) = \\sum_{w \\in N(u) \\cap N(v)} \\frac{1}{\\log k_w}, \\qquad \\text{RA}(u,v) = \\sum_{w \\in N(u) \\cap N(v)} \\frac{1}{k_w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AA</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8374em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∩</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RA</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8374em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∩</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>度越大的共同邻居贡献越小（这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 即 <a href=\"../foundations/graph-basics\">图的基本概念</a> 里的度）。<strong>Jaccard 系数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∩</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|N(u)\\cap N(v)|/|N(u)\\cup N(v)|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣/∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 则做归一化。这些启发式无需训练、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\deg)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">de<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级、可解释，是任何链接预测项目都该先跑的基线——很多论文里花哨的深度模型其实赢不过调好的 Adamic–Adar。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监督学习-把它变成二分类\">监督学习：把它变成二分类</h2><p>启发式只用了一个相似性分数。监督方法把链接预测显式建成二分类：每个节点对是一个样本，标签是「最终有没有连边」，特征则把多种信号拼在一起——共同邻居数、Adamic–Adar、两端的各种 <a href=\"../metrics/centrality\">中心性</a>、是否同社区（来自 <a href=\"../metrics/community-detection\">社区发现</a>）、节点自身属性等。然后用逻辑回归、梯度提升树等任意分类器训练。</p>\n<p>它的优势是能融合异质信号、能利用节点属性；难点在<strong>负样本采样</strong>：图中「不存在的边」数量是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，远多于存在的边，必须下采样，而采样策略会显著影响结果。一个稳健做法是按度分布匹配地采负样本，而不是均匀随机——否则模型可能只学会了「高度节点更可能连边」这种平凡规律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"嵌入方法-让表示学特征\">嵌入方法：让表示学特征</h2><p>监督方法的特征是手工设计的。嵌入方法则让模型自动学：先用 <a href=\"graph-embeddings\">图嵌入</a> 把每个节点压成向量，再用两个端点向量的某种组合（内积、Hadamard 逐元素乘、L1/L2 距离）作为这条边的特征喂给分类器，或直接用内积大小当连边分数。</p>\n<p>这类方法能捕捉启发式看不见的高阶结构（不止共同邻居，还有路径模式、社区归属），在复杂网络上往往准确率最高。基于随机游走的 node2vec、归纳式的 GraphSAGE、以及现代图神经网络都走这条路，细节留给 <a href=\"graph-embeddings\">图嵌入</a>。代价是可解释性差、训练成本高，且要小心嵌入是在「补边之前」还是「之后」的图上训练——后者会造成信息泄露。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估-最容易翻车的一关\">评估：最容易翻车的一关</h2><p>链接预测的评估远比看起来危险。第一个坑是<strong>切分方式</strong>：如果是预测「未来的边」，必须按时间切分（用过去的图训练、预测未来的边，对应 <a href=\"../foundations/network-types\">网络类型</a> 的时序图），随机切分会让未来信息泄露进训练。</p>\n<p>第二个坑更隐蔽——<strong>指标选择</strong>。真实图极度稀疏，正样本（真实边）占所有节点对的比例可能不到万分之一。在这种极端不平衡下，AUC（ROC 曲线下面积）会给出虚高的漂亮数字，因为大量「真负」轻易被排在后面就拉高了分数。2025 年关于链接预测评估的研究明确建议改用对不平衡敏感的指标：AUPR（精确率-召回率曲线下面积）和 Hits@K（前 K 个预测里命中多少真实边）更能反映实际可用性。第三个坑是基线——任何新方法都该和 Adamic–Adar、以及在 <a href=\"random-graph-models\">随机图模型</a> 零模型上的表现对比，否则无法证明它学到了真东西。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>链接预测从描述转向预测：给定图，预测缺失或未来的边，复用中心性、社区、嵌入作特征。</li>\n<li>相似性启发式（共同邻居、Adamic–Adar、资源分配、Jaccard）无需训练、可解释，是必跑的强基线。</li>\n<li>监督二分类能融合异质特征，难点在负样本采样——应按度分布匹配采样，避免学到平凡规律。</li>\n<li>嵌入方法自动学表示、准确率高但难解释，须防「补边后训练」造成的信息泄露。</li>\n<li>评估是最易翻车的一关：预测未来要按时间切分；稀疏图上 AUC 虚高，应改用 AUPR 与 Hits@K（2025 年研究建议）。</li>\n<li>任何新方法都要对比 Adamic–Adar 基线与 <a href=\"random-graph-models\">随机图模型</a> 零模型，详见 <a href=\"../practice/applications-pitfalls\">应用与陷阱</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"链接预测","id":"链接预测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"相似性启发式：便宜的强基线","id":"相似性启发式-便宜的强基线"},{"level":2,"text":"监督学习：把它变成二分类","id":"监督学习-把它变成二分类"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌入方法：让表示学特征","id":"嵌入方法-让表示学特征"},{"level":2,"text":"评估：最容易翻车的一关","id":"评估-最容易翻车的一关"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"随机图模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/network-graph-analysis/models/random-graph-models"},"next":{"title":"图嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/network-graph-analysis/models/graph-embeddings"}}